ars is the best-known emblem of Singapore.','Singapore''s red band includes a crescent and five stars.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-banner-match',10,'boolean','Black stripe on blue is the best-known layout of Botswana.','Botswana''s flag is light blue with a black stripe edged in white.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',1,'boolean','White cross is the best-known emblem of Switzerland.','Switzerland''s square flag is a white cross on red.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',2,'boolean','Dannebrog cross is the best-known emblem of Denmark.','Denmark''s flag is a white Scandinavian cross on red.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',3,'boolean','Union Jack is the common name of United Kingdom.','The UK flag combines the crosses of England, Scotland, and Saint Patrick.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',4,'boolean','Green-white-orange is the colour order of Ireland.','Ireland''s vertical tricolour is green, white, and orange.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',5,'boolean','Fifty stars is the best-known emblem of United States.','The U.S. canton has fifty stars for the fifty states.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',6,'boolean','Double pennon is the unusual shape of Nepal.','Nepal''s flag is the only national flag that is not a rectangle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',7,'boolean','White over red is the colour order of Poland.','Poland''s flag is a horizontal bicolour of white over red.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-flg-flag-classroom',8,'boolean','Eagle and cactus is the best-known emblem of Mexico.','Mexico''s central emblem is an eagle on a cactus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,